   "gap": 0.4,
   "text": "The disability tax credit isn't a cheque. It's an amount that cuts the tax you owe."
  },
  {
   "id": "T2",
   "file": "vo/T2.mp3",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "text": "For twenty twenty-five, it's ten thousand, one hundred and thirty-eight dollars. At the federal rate of fourteen and a half percent, that's about one thousand, four hundred and seventy dollars off federal tax."
  },
  {
   "id": "T3",
   "file": "vo/T3.mp3",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "text": "For a child under eighteen, a supplement adds five thousand, nine hundred and fourteen. Sixteen thousand and fifty-two in total."
  },
